<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman raises Argentine telecoms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman raises Argentine telecoms.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Telecom Argentina SA and Telefonica Argentina SA to outperform from hold.</p>
<p>-- cited moves by the Argentine government to implement a tariff rebalancing plan.</p>
<p>-- said tariff rebalancing plan will be marginally negative in the short term, but will have long-term positives.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
